      "id": 22265,
      "title": "C-Store: A Column-Oriented DBMS",
      "author": "Michael Stonebraker, Daniel J. Abadi, Adam Batkin, Xuedong Chen, Mitch Cherniack, Miguel Ferreira, Edmond Lau, Amerson Lin, Samuel R. Madden, Elizabeth J. O'Neil, Patrick E. O'Neil, Alexander Rasin, Nga Tran, Stan B. Zdonik",
      "year": "2005",
